{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vocator</strong> combines the unpredictability of a roguelike, the strategic planning of a board game, and the tactical depth of an autobattler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>8 unique Vocators</strong>, each with a powerful ability that shapes your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play from a roster of <strong>70 heroes</strong>, placing them on the board to boost your army.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reroll your servants' dice</strong> to land them on tiles occupied by  heroes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and equip <strong>86 artifacts</strong> that enhance heroes, empower servants, or alter core game rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover powerful synergies</strong> between heroes, artifacts, servants, and abilities to maximize your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the <strong>roguelike gameplay loop</strong>, uncovering new strategies and combinations with each run to overcome increasing challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a roguelike enthusiast, a fan of tactical autobattlers, or someone who loves strategic board games, <i>Vocator</i> challenges you to think ahead, adapt fast, and master the mechanics.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Sprinter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3682060/5278c490ec5b0ff6c235d08a2da2622c59c6f994.jpg"},{"name":"It\u2019s over 9000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3682060/65f0a131938af0ecf0b7295b4b23843e3afe65f7.jpg"},{"name":"Domination","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3682060/3dacccdb85e8c039168f797ec0ad61d4277ed047.jpg"},{"name":"Unlocker","pa